Package: sentry.sdk
Title: Rust-Powered Sentry SDK Bindings for R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Adam", "Smielewski", , "adam.smielewski@finccam.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides minimal R bindings to the Sentry Rust SDK for initializing
    a client, capturing messages and structured logs, and creating transactions
    and spans with inbound distributed tracing support.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    R6 (< 3.0.0),
    R6 (>= 2.6.1)
Suggests:
    lgr (< 1.0.0),
    lgr (>= 0.5.2),
    plumber (< 2.0.0),
    plumber (>= 1.3.3)
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc, xz
